            <ArticleTitle>Thermal bowel injury after ultrasound-guided high-intensity focused ultrasound for uterine adenomyosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/uog.18965</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Adenomyosis can cause significant impact in the quality of life of reproductive age women. Increasing importance on uterine preservation and advances in technology have resulted in the emerging use of minimally invasive treatment options, including high-intensity focused ultrasound (HIFU) therapy.</AbstractText>
